This repository bundles font files that are licensed separately. The same
fonts are distributed twice — once under styles/foundation/fonts/ (source)
and once under ds-bundle/fonts/ (self-contained sync bundle) — and each
copy carries its own license texts alongside it:

  Spoqa Han Sans Neo (Thin/Light/Regular/Medium/Bold)
    SIL Open Font License 1.1
    styles/foundation/fonts/LICENSE-SpoqaHanSansNeo.txt
    ds-bundle/fonts/LICENSE-SpoqaHanSansNeo.txt

  Material Symbols Rounded
    Apache License 2.0
    styles/foundation/fonts/LICENSE-MaterialSymbols.txt
    ds-bundle/fonts/LICENSE-MaterialSymbols.txt

